_982tpNOcQ7kNvwFDC7YQ&_nc_oc=Adq4bn7QFSnQz9tyZQxnCCowqbDi3BYnYGxPeRNyCjbhacmV4aoy7TgyXYIN2zmcVB0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5g6GhpggHJ6Z9xq005TmLm-ZhxSK0_hztSKS6orPM1zg&oe=6A04639D"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot5.png", "id": "294735778406481", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982510_294735781739814_4601886414751003638_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n4sAKuCGzEAQ7kNvwFtypBW&_nc_oc=AdoGcoTy95soWaTv5QYdH3m7mLXop6fDGW3ZcsOHjw7eFpejONej84NY6XPLmEn8r9Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7ZCRkKR5HHuCAJQSGytDvx08togGbMKAdPG1jZpGXJzA&oe=6A04768E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "OLC VR", "keywords": ["learning", "education", "360video", "development", "energy"], "long_description": "Real Learning in a Virtual World: Taking learning to the next level through the World Bank Group (WBG) - Open Learning Campus (OLC)  VR app. \n \nWBG-OLC's immersive learning powers storytelling through bite-sized 360 stories, virtual tours, and visualizations and takes you inside the world of some of the most crucial challanges of global development. \n \nExperience next-generation interactive learning by getting a peek into the most pressing challenges - climate change, education, gender, urban development, international trade, public health, and more. Also available are on-demand resources, expert talks, data visualization, and other online courses through the Open Learning Campus (OLC) Platform.\n \nWhether you are a policymaker, development practitioner, or are curious to learn more, the WBG-OLC VR app is a place to virtually experience real-world challenges.", "short_description": "WBG-OLC's immersive learning powers storytelling through bite-sized 360 stories, virtual tours, and visualizations and takes you inside the world of some of the most crucial challenges of global development.\n\nExperience next-generation interactive learnin